Scr# 2 
  0 \ Load - defers
  1 defer ?BREAK  ' noop is ?break      \ user break check
  2 defer SET-IO  ' noop is set-io      \ set console method
  3 defer ERRFIX  ' noop is errfix      \ on error handler
  4 
  5 3 load      \ load electives and application
  6 
  7  ' (?break) is ?break          \ enable user break
  8  ' dos-io is set-io            \ enable console redirection
  9 \ ' deloutfile +defer errfix    \ delete outfile on error
 10 \ wrtchk off                    \ disable overwrite check
