Scr# 35 
  0 \ SETLEVELS WAVETYPE
  1 \ Set waveform trigger levels
  2 : SETLEVELS  ( -- )
  3   1275  hysteresis 10 *  2dup
  4   - 10 / bias +  0 max 255 min  to silencemin
  5   + 10 / bias +  0 max 255 min  to silencemax ;
  6 
  7 \ Get default wavefile type
  8 : WAVETYPE  ( -- a u )
  9   wave @  case
 10     0  of  s" WAV"  endof
 11     1  of  s" VOC"  endof
 12     2  of  s" RAW"  endof
 13   endcase ;
