  0 \ 0BIT-SQR 1BIT-SQR 0BIT-SIN 1BIT-SIN SENDBIT
  1 \ Bit data
  2 defer 0BIT-SQR  ( a u -- )
  3 defer 1BIT-SQR  ( a u -- )
  4 defer 0BIT-SIN  ( a u -- )
  5 defer 1BIT-SIN  ( a u -- )
  6 
  7 \ Send bit data to output
  8 : SENDBIT  ( a u -- )
  9   polarity @ if
 10     swap over + swap  ( index to inverted bit data )
 11   then
 12   dup wavesiz m+!  writedata ;
