  5 ( inverted )
  6 8080 , 8080 , 8080 , 8080 , 80 c,
  7 decimal
  8 
  9 \ Write leader
 10 : LEADER  ( -- )
 11   leadtime @  408 *  0 ?do
 12     6 0 do  pacebit sendbit  loop
