Scr# 49 
  0 \ 0BIT 1BIT SENDBYTE
  1 defer 0BIT  ( -- )      \ send 0 bit
  2 defer 1BIT  ( -- )      \ send 1 bit
  3 
  4 \ Send character
  5 : SENDBYTE  ( char -- )
  6   sym? if  0bit  then  ( send start bit )
  7   0 swap  databits 0 do
  8     2 /mod
  9     swap if
 10       1bit  swap 1+ swap
 11     else
 12       0bit
 13     then
 14   loop 2drop ;
 15 

Scr# 50 
  0 \ STARTWAVE !SIZE
  1 \ Write header, leader
  2 : STARTWAVE  ( -- )
  3   0. wavesiz 2!
  4   wave @  case
  5     0  of  wav-hdr writedata  endof
  6     1  of  voc-hdr writedata  endof
  7     endcase
  8   leader ;
  9 
 10 \ Patch WAV/VOC data size
 11 : !SIZE  ( u -- )
 12   wavesiz 2@  swap  pad 2!  pad swap writedata ;
