Scr# 51 
  0 \ ENDWAVE
  1 \ Write leader, patch in size
  2 : ENDWAVE  ( -- )
  3   leader
  4   wave @  case
  5     0  of  0 pad c!  pad 1 writedata
  6            40. outfid @  reposf  4 !size
  7            4.  outfid @  reposf
  8            36 wavesiz m+!  4 !size  endof
  9     1  of  0 pad c!  pad 1 writedata
 10            27. outfid @  reposf
 11            2  wavesiz m+!  3 !size  endof
 12     endcase ;
