Scr# 56 
  0 \ SENDDATA SENDPREAMBLE SENDPOSTAMBLE
  1 \ Send program data
  2 : SENDDATA  ( -- )
  3   begin
  4     readchar
  5   while ( not end )
  6     !databyte
  7   repeat ;
  8 
  9 \ Send SYNC string and start character
 10 : SENDPREAMBLE  ( -- )  100  sym? if  10 *  then
 11   0 do  sync sendbyte  loop  [char] *  sendbyte ;
