  0 \ .DECODED .POSITION
  1 \ Display decoded program details
  2 : .DECODED  ( -- )
  3   cr ." Program "  fileid @ hb.
  4   ."  address " saddr @  h.  mode @ if  eaddr @ 1- h.  then
  5   ."  checksum " checksum @ if ." ERROR"  else ." OK" then
  6   2 spaces  decodecount 2@  ud. ." bytes" ;
  7 
  8 \ Show position at which error occured
  9 : .POSITION  ( -- )
 10   ."  at position " infilepos ud.  .decoded  error2 ;
