Scr# 69 
  0 \ HEXCHAR @ASCBYTE @ASCWORD
  1 \ Accumulate hex char to u1
  2 : HEXCHAR  ( u1 char -- u2 )
  3   dup [char] 0  < if badpattern then
  4   dup [char] 9  > if
  5   dup [char] A  < if badpattern then
  6   dup [char] F  > if badpattern then  7 -
  7   then  15 and  swap  16 *  + ;
  8 
  9 \ Read hex ascii byte, bump checksum
 10 : @ASCBYTE  ( -- u )
 11   0  decodebyte hexchar  decodebyte hexchar  +checksum ;
 12 
 13 \ Read hex ascii word
 14 : @ASCWORD  ( -- u )
 15   @ascbyte  @ascbyte  256 *  + ;

Scr# 70 
  0 \ GETID GETADDRESS
  1 \ Get program ID
  2 : GETID  ( -- )
  3   sym? if  @byte  else  @ascbyte  then  fileid ! ;
